  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for QR Code from Excel is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan QR Code barcode from Excel in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode QR Code data message from Excel file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
